# Sahabat Muslim — AI Agent Rules
# Refer to AGENTS.md for complete guidelines, architecture, and deployment SOP.

Please strictly follow the rules defined in `AGENTS.md`:
1. Always work in local repo (/Users/shabudin/Documents/git/sahabatmuslim-landing), git push origin main, then pull on VPS (ssh vps-saya "sudo -u hermes git -C /opt/data/home/sahabatmuslim-landing pull origin main").
2. Database table names must be generic (e.g. `user_sync_data`) — NEVER specific to 'ramadhan'.
3. Always implement Smart Merge (Union) for user worship data sync so no record is overwritten or lost.
4. Mobile menu consistency across all HTML files with pointer-events: none on button children, and bump cache-buster versions (e.g. `nav.js?v=X`, `ramadhan.js?v=X`).
5. Genuine Arabic font rendering (`font-family: 'Amiri', serif`), authentic hadith narrations.
6. Always keep README.md, docs/API_AND_DATABASE.md, and AGENTS.md updated when features/endpoints are changed.
